  {
    "episode_id": 75275,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/5/75275.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "Now, when you started out back then, I mean, what was it like for you? So you say that you had no idea what you were getting yourself into. Was it, I mean, were there a lot of monitors? Was it just the volume of the calls that were coming in? I mean, what was it? What was it like?",
