  {
    "episode_id": 75275,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/5/75275.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 7,
    "turn_text": "For me, it was more about the training. It was the amount of information that I had to learn within a very short period of time before I could actually go on to the 911 floor and start taking calls or start dispatching, you know, doing one of the four different positions that LAPD has identified for 911 dispatchers.",
